# Why this computer's listening ports could not be read or acted on, in the Ports section.

error-local-ports-busy = Still acting on the last processes. Try again in a moment.
error-local-ports-scan = Could not list this computer's listening ports.
error-local-ports-stopped = The port list stopped updating. Open the Ports section again to retry.
error-local-ports-tool = Neither ss nor lsof is installed, so listening ports cannot be read.
error-local-ports-unsupported = Listing and signalling this computer's ports needs macOS or Linux.
error-local-ports-worker = Could not start reading this computer's ports.
